Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:25.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:27.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别看  别看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look. Don't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.81,0:00:59.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait wait wait wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.14,0:01:13.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.11,0:01:19.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:23.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把她拉开  把她拉开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull her away, pull her away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:06.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到处跑  一直在树林子里找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been out. We've been combing these woods looking for her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.23,0:02:08.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果她一直在那谷仓里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she was in there all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.29,0:02:10.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你们一早就知道了  -别烦我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You knew. - Leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.30,0:02:12.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-肖恩  消停点吧  -别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Shane, just stop, man. - Get your hands off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.70,0:02:16.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我...  -你们早知道  还瞒着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I... - You knew and you kept it from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.12,0:02:17.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不知道  -一派胡言\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't know. - That's bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你们肯定都知道  -我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think y'all knew. - We didn't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.45,0:02:22.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她为什么会在那儿  -你们...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why was she there?! - Your--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.05,0:02:25.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥蒂斯把这些人关在谷仓里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otis put those people in the barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:30.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他死前发现了她所以把她关那儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he found her and put her in there before he was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.13,0:02:31.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我会相信这一套吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You expect me to believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.47,0:02:32.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你把我当白痴吗  -肖恩  别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do I look like an idiot? - Shane, hey hey hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.98,0:02:36.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我才不管你相不相信  -大家都冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't care what you believe! - Everybody just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.23,0:02:37.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-让他滚出我的地盘  -都别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get him off my land! - Please. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.46,0:02:41.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-让我告开导你几句  -别碰他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me tell you something. - Hey. Don't touch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.31,0:02:43.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你折腾够了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't you done enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.15,0:02:53.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说真的  离开我的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it-- off my land.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.19,0:03:06.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.03,0:03:08.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:11.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔为了找她差点没命  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl almost died looking for her, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.65,0:03:13.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们谁都有可能送命  我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any one of us could have. I'm gonna tell you right now--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.54,0:03:16.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个老混蛋  他早就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That son of a bitch, he knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.53,0:03:17.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不知道  他不是这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't know. He's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.85,0:03:20.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是他收留了我们  -是他让我们身处险境\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He opened his home to us. - He put us all endanger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  他藏了一谷仓行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, he kept a barn full of walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:23.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你就发起暴动\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you just start an insurrection,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.48,0:03:25.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分发枪支  杀了他的家人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}hand out guns and massacre his family?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.01,0:03:25.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他那一家早都死了  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}His family's dead, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.91,0:03:26.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是他不那么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he doesn't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:28.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他认为你残忍地杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks you just murdered them in cold blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.07,0:03:29.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  伙计  我才不管他怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man, I don't care what he thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:30.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时正在处理这事  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was handling it, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:31.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我在处理的  你就只会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was handling it and you just--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.86,0:03:34.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只会让我们去树林里找那小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had us out in those woods looking for a little girl
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:37.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我们谁都明白她早已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that every single one of us knew was dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:39.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就做了这点事  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you did. Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.36,0:03:41.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟那老头一样只会妄想\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're just as delusional as that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:43.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在处理这事  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You handling it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须得问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to ask you--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.11,0:05:33.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道她在谷仓里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know she was in the barn?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:51.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实  也许这才是最好的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe in some weird way this is for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:54.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少大家知道后  就可以继续前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least we know and now we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.93,0:05:59.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-前行  -对  就是说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move on? - Yeah, it's just like...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.59,0:06:02.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到她  对大家来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It meant so much to everyone--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.95,0:06:04.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}finding her, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.37,0:06:07.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-然后  -这么说  你们准备继续前进了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And then-- - so now you'll just move on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.59,0:06:08.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果可以的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:12.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我们已经失去过其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we've lost others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.09,0:06:17.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次  这次是索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is-- this is Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:22.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在整个队伍里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole group--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.56,0:06:26.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是与众不同的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.05,0:06:30.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  现在要怎么办呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happens now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.40,0:06:32.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要葬了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We bury her...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.82,0:06:38.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你的继母和哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your stepmom and your stepbrother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:42.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.36,0:06:52.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:55.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我最后会找到她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I'd find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:56.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都这么以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:06:58.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是指  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:01.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我会找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I'd be the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:05.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像她在某处躲猫猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like maybe she was hiding somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.01,0:07:06.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,藏在洞里或者树后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a cave or a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:08.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd be safe
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.07,0:07:11.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我会找到她  带她回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'd find her and bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.57,0:07:17.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他做得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did the right thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.20,0:07:21.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把她射杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}shooting her like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:24.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我  我也会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've done it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:31.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:35.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么了  -你带卡尔到屋子里去行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Could you take Carl up to the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.09,0:07:37.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好好休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.24,0:07:39.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.93,0:07:48.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你帽子忘拿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you dropped that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.25,0:08:00.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在开始埋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want us to start burying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.87,0:08:03.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得做个礼拜仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a service.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:05.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔会希望我们做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol would want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.32,0:08:06.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我们都这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we all want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:15.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们给索菲亚挖个坟墓吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's-- let's dig a grave for Sophia,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:17.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有安妮特和沙恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Annette and Shawn,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.94,0:08:21.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在那边的树底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, over by those trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.30,0:08:24.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还需要一辆卡车把这些尸体运走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll need a truck to move the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:26.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我去拿钥匙  -不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll get the keys. - No no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.81,0:08:29.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.10,0:08:31.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他人呢  都土葬的话工作量太大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the others? That's a lot of digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.08,0:08:34.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我们爱的人土葬了  其他人烧掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We bury the ones we love and burn the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:38.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:46.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did Hershel say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.73,0:08:51.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说要么让肖恩离开农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants us off the farm,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:54.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么我们都离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Shane at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.32,0:08:57.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不算过分\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:09:00.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之中没再死人已经够幸运的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're lucky someone wasn't killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.24,0:09:02.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才那一阵枪声\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all that gunfire--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.28,0:09:04.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会把更多的行尸引来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}more walkers could've heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.05,0:09:11.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:16.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一直都在那里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was there all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.49,0:09:18.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做了力所能及的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you did everything you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.23,0:09:20.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我知道  我是做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. I always do, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.19,0:09:24.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追上她  保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went after her, protected her,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.59,0:09:26.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死那些行尸  可是她还是被咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}killed those walkers, but she still got bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.73,0:09:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔也还是中枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Carl still got shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.25,0:09:32.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都听我的  可是我却让他们去树林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}People counting on me and I had 'em chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:34.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搜寻根本不可能找到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}a ghost in a forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:15.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有话要说吗  戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you got something to say, Dale?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.45,0:10:18.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直说吧  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, go ahead, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.95,0:10:21.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道德权威先生  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Moral authority, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.53,0:10:26.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理性发言人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The--the voice of reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:30.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问你个问题  老兄  你是做什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you something, man. What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:32.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么来保护我们营地的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you do to keep this camp safe, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:34.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是做什么的  修个破房车\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you do? What, you fix up an R.V.?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:36.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像看小孩一样看着枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You babysit some guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:38.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿枪指过我对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you pointed one at my chest, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.51,0:10:42.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你就是开不了枪  你能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you just-- you couldn't pull that trigger, could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.24,0:10:46.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我真是那么危险  威胁了大家的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I was such a danger, if I was such a threat,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:48.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么来阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}what did you do to stop me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.16,0:10:51.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我毁了那个谷仓  我救了卡尔  都是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I smashed that barn. I saved Carl. That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:53.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你也不是瑞克  是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't you. That ain't Rick. That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.67,0:10:56.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你  戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what, Dale--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.85,0:11:01.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次我需要一根水箱软管的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time I need a radiator hose...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.57,0:11:03.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会给你打电话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you a call, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:36.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.39,0:11:52.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.63,0:11:57.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:00.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.19,0:12:03.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为那是你的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause that's your little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:08.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not my little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.18,0:12:13.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's some other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:21.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的索菲亚自己待在树林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Sophia was alone in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.42,0:12:25.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this time I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.86,0:12:32.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她并没有哭着入睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't cry herself to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.79,0:12:34.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她并没有饿肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't go hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.74,0:12:38.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她并没有寻找回来的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't try to find her way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.17,0:12:44.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,索菲亚很久以前就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia died a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.76,0:14:55.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-又得出去一趟  -我们算幸运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A few more trips. - We got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.60,0:14:57.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果那个谷仓里行尸更多的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that barn had any more,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.21,0:14:58.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就搞不定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could've been overrun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.24,0:15:01.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸亏肖恩在正确的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thing Shane did what he did...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.28,0:15:04.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-做了该做的事  -你别告诉我这么做是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- when he did. - You can't tell me this was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.10,0:15:07.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是不对的  那会破坏我们和赫谢尔的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't. It'll cost us with Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:08.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很伤心  但是他会缓过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's grieving. He'll come around,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.03,0:15:10.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}see we had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.00,0:15:13.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也开枪了  不全是肖恩的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I shot too. This wasn't all Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.21,0:15:14.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I got no qualms about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.09,0:15:16.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后院关着一群行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walkers in my backyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.15,0:15:17.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法忍受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hm-mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.71,0:15:18.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是埋怨大家当时不应该这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying that we shouldn't have
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:22.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是有必要制造一场恐慌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}taken care of the problem, but creating a panic?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.05,0:15:24.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再为这件事情争论下去毫无意义  木已成舟\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no point arguing about it. It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.71,0:15:26.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么都做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing we can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:29.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.49,0:15:56.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下  停一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.80,0:16:11.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.28,0:16:24.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们的人要走  你也不会留下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if your group leaves, you wouldn't stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.16,0:16:26.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真没考虑过这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-- I hadn't really thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.95,0:16:30.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I-- I didn't know that--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.26,0:16:34.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得现在是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do-- do you think this is really the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:37.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-讨论这件事的好时机吗  -我真觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to discuss this, I mean? - Well, I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:39.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没什么时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}really feeling like there's a lot of time for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:41.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的  有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no, there-- there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.61,0:16:48.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间是有的  我是说  我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is. I mean, I-I-- I want--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:50.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.88,0:16:53.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  你能听见我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:16:58.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她怎么了  -可能休克了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong with her? - She might be in shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.03,0:17:00.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-赫谢尔哪去了  -我们到处都找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Hershel? - We can't find him anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.19,0:17:05.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.61,0:17:12.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你继母的东西吗  -他坚信她能被治好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your stepmother's things? - He was so sure she'd recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.48,0:17:14.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都保持着他们离开时的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd just pick up where they left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.30,0:17:20.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来他找到了一位老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he found an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.53,0:17:26.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我祖父的  去世的时候传给了我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That belonged to my grandfather, gave it to dad when he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.89,0:17:28.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为赫谢尔不喝酒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't take Hershel for a drinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是不喝  我出生那天他就戒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he gave it up on the day I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.32,0:17:33.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他甚至在家里禁酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't even allow liquor in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.53,0:17:37.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-镇上有酒吧吗  -有  哈特林家的酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the bar in town? - Hatlin's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.99,0:17:40.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他酗酒那些年  几乎天天就泡在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He practically lived there in his drinking days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.83,0:17:41.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打赌能在那儿找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betting that's where I'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.99,0:17:43.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道怎么走  我带你去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I've seen the place. I'll take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.69,0:17:45.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好的  我去开车  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, I'll get the truck. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:47.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不行  -这没啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- N-- no. - It's an easy run.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.89,0:17:49.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-像药房那次吗  -嘿  玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like the pharmacy? - Hey, Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:51.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会带他回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.81,0:17:54.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬  那次不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, that was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.39,0:17:56.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  你动身之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick? You want to have a
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.80,0:17:59.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备告诉我一声吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}conversation about this before you leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:00.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说  你真的要去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're seriously gonna go after this guy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.79,0:18:01.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管这儿的事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with everything that's going on, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.97,0:18:03.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你要怎样  -他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What you gonna do? - He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.86,0:18:05.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是调头走人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not the time to head off, not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.89,0:18:07.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你不知道...  -我不跟你争\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't know what's have-- - I'm not arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.09,0:18:10.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这是我唯一能做的  我们已经  -已经干嘛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the least I can do for Hershel after we-- - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.96,0:18:12.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们干嘛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After we what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.44,0:18:17.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔说  换做是他  他也会杀了索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl said he would've shot Sophia himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:19.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你儿子  他变得冷酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your son. He's getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.81,0:18:21.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他成长的世界充满...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's growing up in a world with--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.93,0:18:26.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他成长的世界需要一个像你这样的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's growing up in a world where he needs a father like you--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.17,0:18:28.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活着  陪着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}around, alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.24,0:18:30.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不是跑来跑去帮助每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not running off, solving everybody else's problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.33,0:18:32.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想解决的不只是他的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just his problem I'm trying to solve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.59,0:18:36.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了你肚子里的孩子  我们需要赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need Hershel for the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.83,0:18:41.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:15.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-准备好了吗  -好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ready? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.43,0:20:10.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:12.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.27,0:20:15.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.50,0:20:17.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿嘿嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey hey hey hey hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.09,0:20:21.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你没事儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:24.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.82,0:20:36.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你女儿的事  我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know that I'm real sorry for your girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.14,0:20:39.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.33,0:20:47.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我打开谷仓时  我根本不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I opened that barn I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.66,0:20:49.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I did...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.09,0:20:56.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都觉得我是个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody thinks that I'm a...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:02.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想保证大家安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just trying to keep everybody safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.55,0:21:11.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本不知道她在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea she was in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.08,0:21:23.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿的日子也不好过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is going to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.45,0:21:25.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我正在努力阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm trying hard to prevent that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.05,0:21:26.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't be able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:29.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法  我们当中有人认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there are people in this group
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.05,0:21:31.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩做的是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}who think that what Shane did was justified.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.97,0:21:33.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你俩合不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you two can't stand each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.28,0:21:35.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他确实做了些正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he did something that needed to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.29,0:21:36.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.78,0:21:38.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他生性冲动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's a hothead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.85,0:21:41.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  洛莉  他真的很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Lori, he's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:44.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得是他杀了奥蒂斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he killed Otis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.63,0:21:47.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥蒂斯是被行尸杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otis was killed by walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:51.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道怎么对付行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew how to handle walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:53.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥蒂斯有本事把它们抓进仓库去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otis was the one who was putting them in the barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.13,0:21:55.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我把话说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to be really clear with me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.23,0:21:58.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你到底是什么意思  -我认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you saying? - I believe that--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:22:01.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩牺牲了奥蒂斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Shane sacrificed Otis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.76,0:22:04.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没法证明  但我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't prove it, but I-I-I--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.26,0:22:06.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他开枪打了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that he-- I think that he shot him
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.29,0:22:09.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后扔下他做诱饵  好让自己脱身\N{\fnArial\fs30}and left him for bait, so that he could get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.30,0:22:13.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩可能很鲁莽  但他不是杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane may be a hothead, but he's not a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.78,0:22:15.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,况且  他怎么会杀一个想帮忙的人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And-- and why would he kill somebody who's trying to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.89,0:22:17.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  也许他当时走投无路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe he was pinned down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.65,0:22:21.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说出来了  当着我的面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said-- he said it. He all but threw it in my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.36,0:22:26.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你说  我了解他这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you-- I knew guys like him,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.10,0:22:27.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迟早\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sooner or later...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.90,0:22:31.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会再次杀人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna kill somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.67,0:23:01.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬说她爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie said she loves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.40,0:23:06.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.91,0:23:08.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说她不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean she can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.81,0:23:09.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean-- well...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.89,0:23:14.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不开心  或是困惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}She-- she's upset or confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.17,0:23:14.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许她觉得...\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's probably feeling, like--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.89,0:23:17.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是个明白人  知道自己心里想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she's smart enough to know what she's feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.09,0:23:20.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:23.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你知道吗  她想恋爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you know what? She wants to be in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.84,0:23:28.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以她需要些东西...去抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she's-- she needs something to-- to, like-- to hold onto.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.26,0:23:30.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦  大家都看得出来玛姬爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, it's pretty obvious to everyone Maggie loves you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.48,0:23:32.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且不只是因为你是这世界仅剩的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not just because you're one of the last men standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.85,0:23:34.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以有什么问题嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.86,0:23:37.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有说爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.97,0:23:42.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前从来没女人跟我说这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never had a woman say that to me before
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.29,0:23:44.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  除了我妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except my mom, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.86,0:23:46.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我的姐姐们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.63,0:23:49.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可玛姬不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with Maggie, it's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.68,0:23:50.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们根本不了解对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We barely know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.69,0:23:52.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她了解我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What-- what does she really know about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.75,0:23:53.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.80,0:23:57.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几乎是两个陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're practically strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.01,0:23:58.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我  我不知道怎么处理这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I-- I didn't know what to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.50,0:24:00.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我像个傻瓜似的站在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just stood there like a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.81,0:24:03.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, this is a good thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.72,0:24:05.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这个世道正缺少的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something we don't get enough of these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.46,0:24:06.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,享受吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.57,0:24:09.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我们回来了  再回报她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when we get back, return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.43,0:24:11.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她又去不了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like she's going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.35,0:24:25.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.03,0:24:27.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道洛莉...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know about Lori,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.52,0:24:29.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怀孕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her being pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.28,0:24:32.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我给她弄的药  -我早知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got her those pills. - I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.42,0:24:41.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉我瞒了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm sorry I kept it from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.76,0:24:45.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  你做了自己认为对的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be. You did what you thought was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.87,0:24:48.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是碰巧你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just so happens it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.43,0:25:14.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她心跳加快  烧起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her heart's racing. She's burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.06,0:25:16.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要赫谢尔  他知道怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need Hershel. He'll know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.37,0:25:23.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你能帮我照看下卡尔吗  -当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you look in on carl for me? - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.50,0:25:32.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要搬到这荒郊野外来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving to the suburbs?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.35,0:25:37.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝丝有点处于紧张性休克状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Beth's in some kind of catatonic shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.99,0:25:41.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们需要赫谢尔  -所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need Hershel. - Yeah. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.73,0:25:43.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我要你快速进城一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I need you to run into town real quick
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.28,0:25:45.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他和瑞克带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And bring him and Rick back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.64,0:25:48.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.74,0:25:52.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们女人站着说话不腰疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bitch went window-shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.89,0:25:54.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要他就自己去带他回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want him? Fetch him yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.74,0:25:57.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有别的事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got better things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.67,0:25:59.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.29,0:26:00.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别那么自私\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you be so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.75,0:26:03.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自私?  听着  奥丽弗(动画片《大力水手》中女主角)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selfish? Listen to me, olive oyl.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.29,0:26:06.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我每一天都出去找那个小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was out there looking for that little girl every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.64,0:26:08.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挨了一枪还中了一箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took a bullet and an arrow in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.42,0:26:10.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跟我说我没有尽心尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you tell me about me getting my hands dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.18,0:26:14.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要找那两个笨蛋  祝你一帆风顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want those two idiots? Have a nice ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.56,0:26:17.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再去找人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done looking for people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.03,0:26:38.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.10,0:26:41.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁跟你一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.73,0:26:43.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.17,0:26:47.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬让他来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie sent him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.02,0:26:50.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他自愿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He volunteered.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.63,0:27:07.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-喝了多少瓶了  -还不够多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many have you had? - Not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.31,0:27:12.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家再把这瓶喝完吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's finish this up back at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.57,0:27:15.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝丝晕倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth collapsed,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.03,0:27:21.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是受了惊吓  想必你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be in shock. I think you are too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.03,0:27:24.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬和她在一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie's with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.35,0:27:27.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  但是贝丝需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but beth needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.54,0:27:29.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能做什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.98,0:27:31.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她需要她母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.10,0:27:33.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更确切地说是需要悼念她\N{\fnArial\fs30}or rather to mourn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.04,0:27:37.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几个礼拜前她就该这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like she should've done weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.61,0:27:43.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.03,0:27:47.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前认为有解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought there was a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.83,0:27:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要因为一直坚持希望而责怪自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't blame yourself for holding out for hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.38,0:27:53.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.44,0:28:00.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我第一次看到你抱着你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I first saw you running across my field
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.12,0:28:02.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿过田地的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your boy in your arms,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.87,0:28:06.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对他活下来不抱希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had little hope he would survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.32,0:28:08.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.23,0:28:10.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.94,0:28:13.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管我们失去了奥蒂斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though we lost Otis.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.74,0:28:16.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的人肖恩回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your man Shane made it back
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.83,0:28:18.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们救了你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we saved your boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.85,0:28:24.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个奇迹向我证实却有奇迹存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the miracle that proved to me miracles do exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.23,0:28:30.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却不过是个假象  诱你上钩  然后调包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only it was a sham, a bait and switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.19,0:28:36.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个傻子  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a fool, Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.36,0:28:39.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的人都看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you people saw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.04,0:28:48.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的女儿们不该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughters deserve better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.62,0:29:58.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么办  等他昏倒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do? Just wait for him to pass out?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.72,0:30:00.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.95,0:30:03.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.05,0:30:06.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我向玛姬保证我会把你安全带回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised maggie I'd bring you home safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.87,0:30:10.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如你向那个小姑娘保证的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you promised that little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.58,0:30:16.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你的计划是什么  喝完那瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's your plan? Finish that bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.00,0:30:18.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝到死为止  留下你的女儿们孤孤单单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink yourself to death and leave your girls alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.08,0:30:19.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop telling me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.90,0:30:22.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么照顾我的家庭  我的农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}How to care for my family, my farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.54,0:30:25.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些人就像祸水\N{\fnArial\fs30}You people are like a plague!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.22,0:30:28.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我按基督教义行事  给你们安身之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do the christian thing, give you shelter,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.25,0:30:31.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们却毁了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you destroy it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.28,0:30:33.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来时世道已经混乱不堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world was already in bad shape when we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.45,0:30:35.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你却不负责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you take no responsibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.28,0:30:37.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该领导他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to be their leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.98,0:30:40.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这不是在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm here now, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.43,0:30:47.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.04,0:30:53.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.15,0:31:04.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.02,0:31:07.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的女儿此刻最需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your girls need you now more than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.02,0:31:10.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不该相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.06,0:31:13.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉我没法治愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me there was no cure,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.02,0:31:15.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人不是得病  而是已经死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That these people were dead, not sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.73,0:31:18.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿不去相信这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I chose not to believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.53,0:31:21.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可当我看到肖恩一枪打中卢的胸口\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when shane shot lou in the chest
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.40,0:31:23.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还是扑过来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she just kept coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.23,0:31:26.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才知道自己有多傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when I knew what an ass I'd been,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.34,0:31:30.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮特早就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That annette had been dead long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.31,0:31:32.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在喂养一具腐尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was feeding a rotten corpse!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.51,0:31:35.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我才知道我没有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when I knew there was no hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.02,0:31:41.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当那个小女孩走出谷仓时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when that little girl came out of the barn,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.06,0:31:44.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从你脸上的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The look on your face--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.79,0:31:46.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就看出你已经知道这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you knew it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.13,0:31:50.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.80,0:31:52.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本没有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.03,0:31:57.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在也看得出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know it now, like I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.90,0:32:00.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.67,0:32:09.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们根本没有任何希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no hope for any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.15,0:32:42.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.25,0:32:43.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.65,0:32:47.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种事  我们究竟还要做多少次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, how many times we gonna have to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.62,0:32:53.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受够了  我不会再这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm done. I'm not doing this anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.73,0:32:55.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为你收拾残局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cleaning up after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.20,0:32:56.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想听实话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what the truth is?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.70,0:32:59.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事都没有改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.37,0:33:02.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死就是死  人终有一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death is death. It's always been there,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.60,0:33:04.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论是死于心脏病 癌症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether it's from a heart attack, cancer,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.80,0:33:07.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是成为行尸  有什么区别吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a walker. What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.37,0:33:09.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前你可没有这样绝望吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't think it was hopeless before, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.91,0:33:11.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在家里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there are people back
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.36,0:33:13.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在努力活下去  他们需要我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}at home trying to hang on. They need us,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.68,0:33:16.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是给他们一个活下去的理由也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it's just to give them a reason to go on,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.15,0:33:18.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即便是我们自己也不相信也罢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we don't believe it ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.99,0:33:22.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这已经不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? This-- this isn't about
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.69,0:33:24.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们相不相信的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we believe anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.29,0:33:28.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是他们相信与否\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.61,0:33:47.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真没想到  见到活人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch. They're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.11,0:33:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫戴夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dave.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.08,0:34:00.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个皮包骨头的棒槌是托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That scrawny-looking douche bag there is tony.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.39,0:34:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃我啊（滚蛋）  戴夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat me, dave.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.62,0:34:03.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定哪天我就吃了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, maybe someday I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.52,0:34:06.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在费城那边的高速上遇到他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We met on I-95 coming out of philly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.29,0:34:08.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边的景象好凄惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn shit-show that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.10,0:34:11.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫格伦  很高兴见到一些新面孔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Glenn. It's nice to meet some new people.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.90,0:34:13.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克 格兰姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick Grimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.10,0:34:16.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老哥你贵姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you, pal? Have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.27,0:34:17.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚退出了组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.07,0:34:20.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朋友  你可真会选时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a unique sense of timing, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.28,0:34:21.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name's Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.31,0:34:23.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他今天失去很多亲友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lost people today, a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.51,0:34:27.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,节哀顺便\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm truly sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.32,0:34:31.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为明天会更好和结交新朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}To better days and new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.75,0:34:33.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及逝去的亲友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to our dead--
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.92,0:34:36.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿他们永享极乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}May they be in a better place.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.83,0:34:47.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.03,0:34:51.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在一个警察身上拿来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it off a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.84,0:34:53.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是个警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.27,0:34:55.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的这个已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one was already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.04,0:35:00.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们大老远从费城到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fellas are a long way from philadelphia.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.03,0:35:02.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从这里到哪里都很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels like we're a long way from anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.00,0:35:03.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么促使你到南边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what drove you south?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.12,0:35:05.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定不是天气的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can tell you it wasn't the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.72,0:35:08.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光是流汗  我就大概减了15斤左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must've dropped 30 lbs. In sweat alone down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.25,0:35:09.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吹牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.46,0:35:10.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实本打算先去华府\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, first it was d.C.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.36,0:35:13.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说那边有难民营\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard there might be some kind of refugee camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.33,0:35:16.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果公路堵塞  我们寸步难行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the roads were so jammed, we never even got close.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.46,0:35:19.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是决定不走公路  而走乡间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We decided to get off the highways, into the sticks,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.40,0:35:21.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一路马不停蹄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep hauling ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.50,0:35:22.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遇到的每一伙人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every group we came across
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.74,0:35:24.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都说有逃出升天的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}had a new rumor about a way out of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.94,0:35:26.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人说驻扎在海湾的海警\N{\fnArial\fs30}One guy told us there was the coast guard sitting in the gulf,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.91,0:35:28.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将渡船发往各个小岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sending ferries to the islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.68,0:35:30.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,近期又说蒙哥马利那边有个火车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}The latest was a rail yard in montgomery
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.68,0:35:32.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里有火车开往中部地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running trains to the middle of the country--
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.35,0:35:33.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,堪萨斯  内布拉斯加等地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kansas, Nebraska.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.55,0:35:34.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内布拉斯加吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nebraska?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.95,0:35:36.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人口稀少  枪支泛滥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Low population, lots of guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.92,0:35:37.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这倒是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.19,0:35:40.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去过内布拉斯加吗  小伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever been to nebraska, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.89,0:35:43.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那里称作是穷乡僻壤是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A reason they call 'em flyover states.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.60,0:35:51.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.50,0:35:53.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本宁堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fort benning, eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.60,0:35:57.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警官  我不想打击你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to piss in your cornflakes, officer, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.64,0:36:01.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们遇到过几个驻扎在本宁堡的士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ran across a grunt who was stationed at benning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.04,0:36:03.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说那边已被群尸占领\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said the place was overrun by lamebrains.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.45,0:36:06.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本宁堡已经失陷了  真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, fort benning is gone? Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.28,0:36:07.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.69,0:36:13.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话  这件事没有解决办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oddly, the truth is there is no way out of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.32,0:36:16.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能不断幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep going from one pipe dream to the next,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.05,0:36:19.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要被丧失心智的怪物抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't grab a hold of you when you sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.42,0:36:20.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你还能睡着的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.63,0:36:24.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  看起来你们并不住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it doesn't look like you guys are hanging your hats here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.56,0:36:26.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在有其他藏身处吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You holed up somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.90,0:36:30.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.46,0:36:34.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门口是你们的车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those your cars out front?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.98,0:36:37.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.92,0:36:39.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们住在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're living in ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.63,0:36:42.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你们的车又空又干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those look kinda empty, clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.67,0:36:46.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你们的行李在哪里  -我们一大队人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's all your gear? - We're with a larger group
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.26,0:36:49.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来侦查  顺便喝两杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}out scouting, thought we could use a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.11,0:36:51.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝两杯  赫谢尔  你不是戒酒了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A drink? Hershel, I thought you quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.28,0:36:55.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想在这附近扎营\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're thinking of setting up around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.87,0:36:59.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这里安全吗  -还算安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it-- is it safe? - It can be,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.21,0:37:02.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管我在附近干掉过几只行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although I have killed a couple of walkers around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.96,0:37:04.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"行尸"  你们这样叫它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walkers? That what you call them?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.97,0:37:07.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没错  -挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.45,0:37:09.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢  这称呼比"蠢蛋"更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that. I like that better than lamebrains.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.32,0:37:10.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更简洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}More succinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.57,0:37:14.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好吧  托尼上过大学  -只上了2年\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, Tony went to college. - Two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.63,0:37:25.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  你们是在郊区\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what-- so what, you guys set up
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.28,0:37:27.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是别的地方扎营\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the outskirts or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.38,0:37:30.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那片新小区  -家庭拖车还是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That new development? - Trailer park or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.81,0:37:31.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是农场吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A farm?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.00,0:37:35.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,*老麦克唐纳有个农场*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Old McDonald had a farm*
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.55,0:37:38.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有农场吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a farm?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.91,0:37:50.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-安全吗  -肯定安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it safe? - It's gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.40,0:37:53.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有食物和水吗  -有妞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got food, water? - You got cooze?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.49,0:37:54.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很久没干过女人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't had a piece of ass in weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.92,0:37:56.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  原谅我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, pardon my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.30,0:37:58.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城里孩子说话冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}City kids-- they got no tact.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.43,0:37:59.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No disrespect.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.56,0:38:04.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-听着  格兰  -我们说的够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So listen, Glenn-- - We've said enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.13,0:38:07.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  这农场听起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hang on a second. This farm-- it sounds pretty sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.11,0:38:10.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-听起来是不是很棒  托尼  -没错  非常棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't it sound sweet, Tony? - Yeah, real sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.04,0:38:12.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来点南方人的热情好客如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a little southern hospitality?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.33,0:38:17.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们营地还有兄弟  日子过得挺艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got some buddies back at camp, been having a real hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.75,0:38:19.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不给我们腾点地方呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see why you can't make room for a few more.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.73,0:38:21.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以共享资源和人力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can pool our resources, our manpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.57,0:38:24.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  这不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry. That's not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.01,0:38:31.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来没什么问题啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't sound like it'd be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.86,0:38:33.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我们不能那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.92,0:38:35.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能再接收更多人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't take in any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.06,0:38:40.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可跟我想的不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.60,0:38:43.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我们是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought-- I thought we were friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.53,0:38:48.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也有人需要照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got people we gotta look out for too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.36,0:38:52.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们一点都不了解你们  -没错  你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't know anything about you. - No, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.58,0:38:56.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一点都不了解我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know anything about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.22,0:39:00.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道我们在外面经历过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what we've had to go through out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.85,0:39:04.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些我们不得不干的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things we've had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.42,0:39:10.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打赌有些事你自己也被迫做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you've had to do some of those same things yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.01,0:39:11.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.55,0:39:19.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这个世道  没有谁的手是干净的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause ain't nobody's hands clean in what's left of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.82,0:39:22.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.12,0:39:25.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So come on, let's--
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.86,0:39:28.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们快乐的坐着拖拉机去农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take a nice friendly hayride to this farm
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.53,0:39:30.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后好好认识一下对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll get to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.69,0:39:35.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不可能发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.40,0:39:37.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这简直是胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.06,0:39:38.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-冷静一下  -别叫我冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Calm down. - Don't tell me to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.76,0:39:40.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远别对我说冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever tell me to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.79,0:39:41.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要崩了你们三个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll shoot you three assholes
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.68,0:39:43.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后把他妈的农场抢过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the head and take your damn farm!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.21,0:39:46.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  等等  放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa whoa whoa whoa whoa whoa. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.69,0:39:49.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张  谁也不会杀谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. Nobody's killing anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.72,0:39:51.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁也不会崩了谁  对吧瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's shooting anybody. Right, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.81,0:39:57.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.66,0:40:03.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是几个朋友喝一杯  仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just friends having a drink. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.91,0:40:08.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好酒放哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now where's the good stuff, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.62,0:40:11.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好酒  好酒  让我找找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good stuff, good stuff, good stuff. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.44,0:40:16.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.93,0:40:18.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这酒可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.76,0:40:23.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta understand--
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.35,0:40:26.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能待在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stay out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.04,0:40:29.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道外面是什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what it's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.16,0:40:31.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.50,0:40:34.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但农场现在太拥挤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the farm is too crowded as is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.23,0:40:37.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  但你必须继续找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. You'll have to keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.87,0:40:39.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续寻找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.32,0:40:42.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我该去哪里找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you suggest we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.31,0:40:45.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.72,0:40:48.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说内布拉斯加州不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear Nebraska's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.72,0:40:52.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内布拉斯加州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nebraska.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.53,0:40:54.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你啊...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy...

